---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { modelIdentity, siteIdentity } from '../lib/site';
---

<Layout>
	<p class="eyebrow">{siteIdentity.author} · {siteIdentity.name}</p>
	<h1>Chiropractic, open for discussion.</h1>
	<p class="lede">
		I’m Dr. Matt Santos, a self-proclaimed chiropractic nerd. This is where I explore the
		philosophy, science, and art of chiropractic through writing, practical questions,
		and the development of the Coherent Chiropractic Model.
	</p>
	<div class="hero-actions">
		<a class="button" href="/articles/">Read the articles →</a>
		<a class="button secondary" href="/model/">Explore the Coherent Chiropractic Model →</a>
	</div>
	<section aria-labelledby="featured-model-title">
		<p class="eyebrow">A {siteIdentity.name} project · v0.1</p>
		<h2 id="featured-model-title">{modelIdentity.name}</h2>
		<p class="section-intro">
			Guided by first principles and tested against reality, the Coherent Chiropractic Model sets out
			an account of chiropractic with its claims, reasoning, evidence, and practical implications
			open to examination. Version 0.1 makes the proposed structure visible as the work develops.
		</p>
		<a href="/articles/toward-a-coherent-model-of-chiropractic/">Read the introduction: Toward a Coherent Model of Chiropractic →</a>
	</section>
</Layout>
